    text: "@scene_meta_time: Y17,511 M7 D32 or later"
  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_strict_terminal_state: Y17,511 M7 D32 or later"
  - line: 13
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_chronology_qualification: M7 D32 remains only the last-supported external-world editorial anchor."
  - line: 14
    type: narration
    text: "Chapter 053 begins already inside a Void Jump from Chapter 052's void aftermath and supplies no measurable ordinary-world elapsed interval."
  - line: 15
    type: narration
    text: "The immediate aftermath, between-moments language, micro-duration processing, historical references, and compressed travel do not advance the framing calendar."
  - line: 16
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_internal_temporal_condition: Immediate aftermath of Lentharis's displacement; no rest, treatment, departure, or measurable recovery interval."
  - line: 17
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_historical_sub-anchor: Sundering of Light / Protocol Deepest Dusk approximately 10,000 years before the present Umbrageous sequence; represented history only."
  - line: 18
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_pov: Geralt-centered third person"
  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_location: Darkened Resonance Pool Chamber in the orphaned Umbrageous Spire"
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_participants: Geralt; Oreck; Kyh; coherent Luminaire; wounded Applicator; Kethran; surviving and half-transformed Proto-Dracos nearby"
  - line: 21
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Assess Umbrageous's qualified completion, isolate the Applicator from the external network, and state the contradictory remaining-target sequence."
  - line: 22
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_boundary_evidence: The separator after Lentharis's sacrifice/displacement introduces a distinct aftermath, diagnosis, containment procedure, and terminal mission assessment."
  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity: Umbrageous is stable but dormant and orphaned, not fully restored."
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "Harmonic isolation prevents external network communication while preserving local Applicator functionality."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "The harmonic cage is a local Kethran/Solantri mechanism and is not connected to the physically undelivered Forest or Plains Sound fragments."
  - line: 26
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_presentation: Aftermath, containment procedure, qualified completion, and next-target handoff"
  - line: 27
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_cutscene_purpose: Complete the fourth operational intervention while establishing permanent costs, an isolated but functional Applicator, and a direct campaign-target contradiction."
  - line: 28
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_hidden/unshown_intervals: Kethran's route to the Resonance Pool is unstaged; no treatment, armor repair, recovery, departure, or ordinary travel interval is shown."
  - line: 29
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_contradictions: Chapter 053 completes Umbrageous as the fourth intervention target by leaving it stable but dormant, yet it does not state four down/one to go."
  - line: 30
    type: narration
    text: "Instead Luminaire says two spires remain—the Shattered Mind and the Ghost Spire itself—contradicting Chapter 052's completed five-target list, in which Umbrageous and Shattered Mind were the final two."
  - line: 31
    type: narration
    text: "The reintroduction of Ghost Spire as a remaining target is unexplained."
  - line: 32
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_chronological_overlap: None established."
  - line: 33
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_chapter_054_handoff_warning: Chapter 054 opening appears to skip over or misname the immediately preceding Umbrageous operation and introduces an unstaged skiff transition."
  - line: 34
    type: narration
    text: "It opens with the silence after Zar'Vokh, places the party aboard a repurposed Anunnaki skiff without staging departure, acquisition, boarding, or travel, and reportedly contains Luminaire/Kyh pronoun drift."
  - line: 35
    type: narration
    text: "This does not erase Umbrageous and must be reviewed in Chapter 054."
  - line: 36
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.umbrageous: Operationally completed as the fourth intervention; stable but dormant, Spire orphaned, Resonance Pool dark/inert, local future unresolved, and not fully restored."
  - line: 37
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.lentharis: Lost/scattered in thin spaces between moments, still watching in some sense but unreachable; not cleanly confirmed dead."
  - line: 38
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.proto-dracos: Forced evolution halted at 18%; some remain half-transformed and in pain."
  - line: 39
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.geralt_physical_state: Psychically injured and untreated, inherited burns and marble-white scars unresolved, no rest interval, and helped upright after the confrontation."
  - line: 40
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.dragon_mail: Stage 1 remains highest named state; damaged, structurally compromised, unrepaired, and locally functional."
  - line: 41
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.flight: Sustained flight remains an established capability but is unused in Chapter 053; wings deployed not for flight."
  - line: 42
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.anchor_symbiosis: Approximately 80% remains last explicit; the Anchor aided resistance, participated in the attack path, and survives intact."
  - line: 43
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.foundational_signature: Permanently consumed and not reused."
  - line: 44
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.luminaire: Coherent, reconstituted, conversational, distinct from the Applicator, strained but intact; Architect/echo resonance language does not downgrade her."
  - line: 45
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.applicator: Wounded and shuddering, locally functional for calculation, interface, and armor control, but externally deaf and mute inside the harmonic cage."
  - line: 46
    type: narration
    text: "It is neither destroyed nor cured."
  - line: 47
    type: narration
    text: "Shared partnership memory strengthens identity/personhood continuity without technically authenticating the head unit's hardware provenance."
  - line: 48
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.zaron: Absent; Dragon Mail control remains Applicator-linked rather than Zaron agency."
  - line: 49
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.oreck: Alive, armorless, untreated, mentally strained, newly struck and physically injured, and still traveling with the party."
  - line: 50
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.kyh: Still traveling with the party."
  - line: 51
    type: narration
    text: "Persistent white U-779 mark, ordinary-shadow recoil, and beacon/fault function remain unresolved despite Chapter 053's normal shadow movement and rematerialization."
  - line: 52
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.vek'tar: Absent; terminal ontology remains unresolved."
  - line: 53
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.kaelen_objective: Kaelen absent; original recruitment objective displaced and unfulfilled."
  - line: 54
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.five_mikas: All five remain last-established active from Chapter 051; only Violet is directly restaged in Chapter 053, while the collective chorus appears only as Geralt's memory/feeling."
  - line: 55
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.mika: Dead; appears only in memory of blue flowers and her grave, with no resurrection."
  - line: 56
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.protocol_key: Unused and unresolved."
  - line: 57
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.sound_fragments: Forest and Plains fragments remain physically undelivered; the harmonic cage is an independent local mechanism."
  - line: 58
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.third/fourth_fragment: Unresolved."
  - line: 59
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.hydros: Custody unresolved."
  - line: 60
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.terros: Custody unresolved."
  - line: 61
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.pyros: Still only apparently consumed/destroyed; Chapter 053 supplies no definitive new evidence."
  - line: 62
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.faraxar_memory: Inaccessible; Geralt's personal memories of Zar'Vokh, Kyh, the Five, Mika's grave, and the peace years do not restore Faraxar autobiographical memory."
  - line: 63
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.federation_clocks: Expired and unresolved; no outcome or reset."
  - line: 64
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.campaign_arithmetic: Inherited list is Umbra, Pyroclast, Zar'Vokh, Umbrageous, Shattered Mind."
  - line: 65
    type: narration
    text: "Umbrageous is the fourth operationally completed intervention, so expected working state is four completed and Shattered Mind alone remaining; source does not say four down/one to go and instead names Shattered Mind plus Ghost Spire as two remaining spires."
  - line: 66
    type: narration
    text: "Do not expand the campaign to six, replace an established target, or silently revise Chapter 052."
  - line: 67
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.shattered_mind: Remains an active next-mission target but is not the sole source-stated remaining target because Ghost Spire is unexpectedly reintroduced."
  - line: 68
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.ghost_spire: Transit provenance remains unresolved; roles as Luminara architecture/reassembly source, Chapter 052 transit residue/retrieval tether, Chapter 053 transit-associated energy, and newly named remaining Spire target are not assumed to explain one another."
  - line: 69
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.network_percentages: Chapter 053 network resonance changes from 55% to 47%."
  - line: 70
    type: narration
    text: "Chapter 052 cascade risk changed from 52% to 44%."
  - line: 71
    type: narration
    text: "These remain separate metrics and are not a continuous percentage series."
  - line: 72
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.network_topology: Umbrageous has no stated SPIRE number."
  - line: 73
    type: narration
    text: "Distributed Applicator networking and sector dormancy do not clarify why five intervention targets relate to the broader eleven-spire network."
  - line: 74
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.enheduanna_activity: No direct action is staged."
  - line: 75
    type: narration
    text: "Luminaire says the Queen is watching and has learned that the Anchor can be hijacked, but no information channel is shown and Enheduanna is not established as the cause of the Applicator-network attack."
  - line: 76
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.node_gamma: Absent; distributed Applicator network is not automatically Node Gamma."
  - line: 77
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.sath'rak: Absent, abandoned, and unresolved."
  - line: 78
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_state_ledger.time-travel_implications: Memory ash, historical holograms, between-moments displacement, null-space, and carrier-wave synchronization establish no global branch, rewrite, loop, erased future, preserved future, or other temporal ontology."
  - line: 79
    type: narration
